{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quirq-ai/monitoring/pulls/2","id":4760513224,"node_id":"PR_kwDOU9GZPM8AAAABG7-qyA","html_url":"https://github.com/quirq-ai/monitoring/pull/2","diff_url":"https://github.com/quirq-ai/monitoring/pull/2.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/quirq-ai/monitoring/pull/2.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quirq-ai/monitoring/issues/2","number":2,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"M0: Scaffold","user":{"login":"quirq-gates","id":333820652,"node_id":"U_kgDOE-Wy7A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333820652?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quirq-gates","html_url":"https://github.com/quirq-gates","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quirq-gates/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quirq-gates/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quirq-gates/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quirq-gates/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quirq-gates/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quirq-gates/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quirq-gates/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quirq-gates/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quirq-gates/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!-- ccr-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"sharmasuraj0123\"} -->\n_Requested by **suraj** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01QBFS1qjoEpLJZCfZNoACwg?thread=cmsg_01QBFS1qjoEpLJZCfZNoACwgEGihjzjQ1iWgqTkqFgWEfM)_\n\nBefore: the repo holds only the plan (README.md, AGENTS.md). Nothing serves.\n\nAfter: `pnpm build && pnpm start` serves the empty shell: the quirq wordmark header, a theme toggle that follows the phone's setting until a cookie overrides it, and a Today page with three tiles that read `unknown` because no source is read yet. Lint, typecheck, contrast unit tests, build and the Playwright suite (390 and 1280 px, light and dark) run in CI.\n\nThis is the M0 scaffold from AGENTS.md: suraj's commit 141010b plus one review follow-up commit (screenshots moved out of the tree, Playwright starts the server with plain `pnpm exec` like CI, no CI retries).\n\nHow: Next.js 16.3.8 App Router, TypeScript strict, Tailwind 4, shadcn Button and Badge copied from shadcn-ui/ui at 295a1f1 with the destructive-contrast fix AGENTS.md requires, tokens mapped from xo-space `space_ui/css/themes.css` (quirq dark, linen light), logo files copied unchanged from innernet `public/brand/quirq/` at e64937b, fonts through `next/font`. The theme cookie is read in the root layout, so pages render per request; caching will live at the source fetch from M1 on.\n\n## Checked\n\nNode 22.22.0, pnpm 11.28.2, `PW_CHROMIUM_PATH=/opt/pw-browsers/chromium`:\n\n```\npnpm install --frozen-lockfile   Done in 1.9s\npnpm lint                        clean\npnpm typecheck                   Types generated successfully, tsc clean\npnpm test                        Test Files 1 passed, Tests 3 passed\npnpm build                       Compiled successfully in 9.4s; routes / and /_not-found\npnpm e2e                         5 passed (8.1s)\n```\n\n- Colors: every light and dark token value equals the matching xo-space token (`--bg`, `--bg-2`, `--bg-3`, `--ink`, `--ink-3`, `--ink-4`, `--accent`, `--accent-ink`, `--err`, `--focus-line`, `--chart-1..5`), compared by hand against `space_ui/css/themes.css` lines 7-25 and 62-80.\n- Logo: `wordmark.svg`, `mark.svg`, `app-icon.svg` have the same sha256 as innernet main.\n- CI action pins: `actions/checkout` v7.0.1, `pnpm/action-setup` v6.1.0, `actions/setup-node` v7.0.0 and `actions/upload-artifact` v7.0.1 each match the SHA of their tag (`git ls-remote`).\n- Theme: for each of cookie light/dark/none against OS dark/light, the body background is the expected theme color, and the toggle flips it and stores the cookie (Playwright script, 4 combinations).\n- Contrast: the vitest suite checks text 4.5:1 and borders, inputs and state markers 3:1 against `--background`, `--card` and `--muted` in both themes; the e2e suite checks the same from computed CSS.\n\n## Screenshots\n\n`pnpm e2e` writes `test-results/screenshots/today-{390,1280}-{light,dark}.png`; CI uploads them as the `screenshots` artifact on this PR's run. The four from the run above are in the project folder under `vision/quirq-infra/audits/monitoring-m0-shots/`.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01WVKJU9wf4avZLsjLCSyX4i\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WVKJU9wf4avZLsjLCSyX4i)_","created_at":"2026-10-06T14:53:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T17:14:54Z","closed_at":"2026-10-06T17:14:54Z","merged_at":"2026-10-06T17:14:54Z","merge_commit_sha":"dd0e680b761429093de688446802256c18bfc540","assignees":[{"login":"sharmasuraj0123","id":36091186,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDkxMTg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36091186?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharmasuraj0123","html_url":"https://github.com/sharmasuraj0123","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharmasuraj0123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharmasuraj0123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharmasuraj0123/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharmasuraj0123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharmasuraj0123/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharmasuraj0123/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharmasuraj0123/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharmasuraj0123/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharmasuraj0123/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_reviewe